{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>Shem, Ham, and Japheth.</b> Japheth was the eldest of his brothers, as it says, ״אחי יפת הגדול״ — 'Japheth the elder brother'; and Ham was the youngest, as it says, ״וידע את אשר עשה לו בנו הקטן״ — 'and he knew what his youngest son had done to him.' But he placed Shem first because of his rank, and mentioned Ham after him because that was the order of their birth; therefore he had to mention Japheth last."], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:10:50.458191015Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}